error[E0119]: [CGP-E014] conflicting wiring: `MyNamespace` redirects `@foo.bar` twice, to `@baz` and to `@qux`
  --> src/main.rs:27:10
   |
26 |         @foo.bar => @baz,
   |          ------- first implementation here
27 |         @foo.bar => @qux,
   |          ^^^^^^^ conflicting implementation for `@foo.bar`

For more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0119`.
